# No secrets in this public repository

`https://github.com/IM594/mistral-sticky` is public. GHCR images built from it are also visible.

Never write real Mistral keys, `PROXY_TOKEN`, or live `.env` / `keys.txt` / `cooldown.json` into the tree, tests, Dockerfiles, GitHub Actions logs, or commit messages. Use placeholders only (`change-me`, `replace-with-real-key-N`). Keys are mounted on the server at runtime. Log `key_index` and short fingerprints, never the secret itself.
